      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Transformation, or Soulcasting, can change an object into one of the Ten Essences.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Soulcast, an Elsecaller shifts their perception into the Cognitive Realm and speaks with the Cognitive aspect of the object they want to change. Elsecallers view Soulcasting differently from Lightweavers.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
